{
  "_about": "Loyverse item name -> dish map for the read-only Kitchen Sales page. Copied 2026-10-30 from the Google Sheet Name_Map (the Apps Script's map, with the October renames). '*' is a wildcard; '|' separates several names for one account (e.g. an item's old and new name - receipts keep the name from the time of sale); an empty string means that account does not sell the dish. Tokens are NEVER stored here; they live in .env (gitignored). `pizza` (Step landing-sales, ADR-094) lists each account's pizza items for Kitchen Sales' Pizza tables: Loyverse category names (matched ignoring capitals and extra spaces) and optional item names (the dish cells' rules); temporary until Naoki picks the pizzas in effect. `fcLanding` (Step landing-sales, ADR-094) is FC's landing: `lines` are the sheet's lines in the sheet's order; each item (the dish cells' rules) counts `pos` portions on a line per one sold, and `takes` an amount from another line's stock (shown as \"also taken\"); copied from docs/areas/meat-landing.md -> \"FC's map (ADR-094)\".",
